highlight.js (core build)
Version: 11.11.1
Licence: BSD-3-Clause
Source:  https://www.npmjs.com/package/highlight.js (LICENSE from the highlight.js@11.11.1 package)

This file is a custom bundle of highlight.js's core engine
(highlight.js/lib/core) plus five language grammars — rust, go, python, ini
(registers the "toml" alias), bash, json — built with esbuild
(--bundle --minify --format=iife) so the whole thing self-hosts as one
dependency-free <script> with no CDN and no runtime fetch, matching every
other vendored library in this directory. No highlight.js source was
otherwise modified; only the set of languages included was chosen. To
reproduce: bundle an entry module that imports highlight.js/lib/core and
registers each language module via hljs.registerLanguage(name, fn).

